Verifier sabotage sample, stage 1b, branch stage-1b-roster, base commit c0a2813.
Each entry: what was broken, the check command, the exit code, and the restore.
All sabotages were restored exactly; `git status` shows no tracked modification
afterwards (only this verify/ directory and the rerun accept log are untracked).

